# Database
- Never write to the production database. Produce SQL files only.
- Never run `supabase link`, `supabase db push` or `supabase db reset`.
- Every data-changing migration requires a matching `DRYRUN_` file in
  `supabase/migrations/` (begin; changes; verification selects; rollback;).
  See `supabase/README.md`.

# Builds
- Delete `.next/cache/fetch-cache` before any build used for verification.
  Otherwise the build can reuse stale Supabase responses.
